|-------------------------|------------------------------------------------|
| Participatory Co-design | System feature voting, joint requirement sessions|
| Squad Collaboration     | Peer annotation, lived-experience focus groups  |
| User-Led Governance     | Rotating citizen panels for oversight           |
| Feedback Channels       | Always-on issue tracker, suggestion boards      |

